---
const links = [
  { href: '/projects', label: '全部專案' },
  { href: '/activity', label: '活動紀錄' },
  { href: '/about', label: '關於我' },
  { href: '/resume', label: '履歷' },
  { href: '/support', label: '贊助' },
  { href: '/contact', label: '聯絡' },
  { href: 'https://github.com/Hsiung-Shao', label: 'GitHub', external: true },
];
---

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span>熊少愆 · Hsiung Shao</span>
    <nav class="foot-links" aria-label="頁尾導覽">
      {links.map(link => (
        <a href={link.href} target={link.external ? '_blank' : undefined} rel={link.external ? 'noopener noreferrer' : undefined}>{link.label}</a>
      ))}
    </nav>
    <p class="foot-note">PoE 相關工具都是非官方的粉絲工具，與 Grinding Gear Games 無關。</p>
  </div>
</footer>
